## Priority order

| # | Finding | Severity | Fix cost |
|---|---|---|---|
| F1 | Gitignored files counted as scope violations | Blocking | Small — drop the `--ignored` pass |
| F2 | No path back from `approved` to `planning` | High | Medium — new operation |
| F3 | `;` separator undiscoverable; `files` fails silently | High | Small — validate and document |
| F7 | `--json` ignored on `verify` failure; unbounded dump | Medium | Small |
| F5 | Directory paths rejected; row errors discard the row | Medium | Medium |
| F4 | Angle brackets in prose flagged as placeholders | Medium | Small |
| F8 | Scaffold teaches none of the format's rules | Low | Trivial |
| F6 | Agent-route refusal does not explain itself | Low | Trivial |

F1 and F3 together account for nearly all the wasted effort in this session.
Both are small fixes. F1 blocks all execution; F3 combined with F2 destroyed a
complete, approved plan.

